Bitcoin is currently holding strong at $80,000, but there are still three waves of bag holders clustered above this price, creating significant resistance.

3–6 months realized price: $88,880 — the first ceiling of selling pressure;
12–18 months realized price: $93,450 — the second wall;
6–12 months realized price: $111,850 — the heaviest chunk, which is 29% higher than the current price.

Analysis indicates that for Bitcoin to confirm a bottom, it needs to break through and hold above $88,880. This would allow the latest batch of holders to get back into profit and lighten the first layer of selling pressure. #BTC #eth
